{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>לעינים</b> (to the eyes). Four times in the Masorah: here, and the others — כי האדם יראה לעינים, ומתוק האור וטוב לעינים, וכעשן לעינים. 'Man sees to the eyes' — therefore according to what he sees, it is sweet and good to the eyes, but his end is like smoke to the eyes, for it brought death to all."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:34.116195191Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}